OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-% -$%%-%-$%%%%-!"$--%& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged in Palestine
OL,4,AAction Elbit raid trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were all also charged with violent
OL,7,Fdisorder, although Plastow was
OL,8,Fpreviously found not guilty of this
OL,9,Foffence.
OL,11,FThe group denied any wrongdoing and
OL,12,Fhave been on trial at the Old Bailey
OL,13,Fsince 22 June. Judge Patrick Field
OL,14,Fdischarged the jury earlier after 37
OL,15,Fhours of deliberations.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
